    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You accept Edd Skeleton's invitation to try out his &quot;awesome&quot; video game, but you soon realize that not everything is going as planned. His game seems uninspired and decidedly not fun... and you don't hesitate to point this out to him. Yet, Edd, with his ever-present skeletal smile, does not give up: he adds new challenges, makes the monsters scarier (or at least he tries) and tries to transform your experience into something unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160840/extras/636d9fc18f9329008a286de10703f1dc.poster.avif?t=1755370626\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160840/extras/636d9fc18f9329008a286de10703f1dc.webm?t=1755370626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160840/extras/636d9fc18f9329008a286de10703f1dc.mp4?t=1755370626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But he has not always been a skeleton, while Skull Face will try to scare you to death you will have to overcome challenges using the skull hand gun to defeat terrible monstrous creatures and solve simple puzzles with skulls, between one level and another you will impersonate Edd discovering the mysterious story why he remained trapped in his own game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from giant screaming skeletons..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160840/extras/1bb5be730f1d496321417d7ef8033bca.poster.avif?t=1755370626\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160840/extras/1bb5be730f1d496321417d7ef8033bca.webm?t=1755370626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160840/extras/1bb5be730f1d496321417d7ef8033bca.mp4?t=1755370626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill terrible scary creatures using the skull hand gun..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160840/extras/3f040c378e03334b40c0eedef67880c6.poster.avif?t=1755370626\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160840/extras/3f040c378e03334b40c0eedef67880c6.webm?t=1755370626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160840/extras/3f040c378e03334b40c0eedef67880c6.mp4?t=1755370626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles with skulls..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160840/extras/9bde59a49b00940ce6d108617c79ad3d.poster.avif?t=1755370626\" width=300 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160840/extras/9bde59a49b00940ce6d108617c79ad3d.webm?t=1755370626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160840/extras/9bde59a49b00940ce6d108617c79ad3d.mp4?t=1755370626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Tell Edd Skeleton that his game sucks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Get scared by screaming skulls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Take part in bizarre scenes and situations with skeletons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discover Edd's mysterious story Skeleton.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Developed by one person with unreal engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160840/extras/965ccd195ae3edcec0bd8803416ea607.poster.avif?t=1755370626\" width=390 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160840/extras/965ccd195ae3edcec0bd8803416ea607.webm?t=1755370626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3160840/extras/965ccd195ae3edcec0bd8803416ea607.mp4?t=1755370626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
